WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:05.611
It was a bright morning.

2
00:00:05.612 --> 00:00:12.125
The kitchen was quiet.

3
00:00:12.126 --> 00:00:16.463
The oven door opened.

4
00:00:16.464 --> 00:00:29.310
Cupcake popped out!

5
00:00:29.311 --> 00:00:55.528
Cupcake jumped onto the kitchen counter.

6
00:00:55.529 --> 00:01:00.417
Her icing sparkled.

7
00:01:00.418 --> 00:01:05.383
"Hello, world!" she said.

8
00:01:05.384 --> 00:01:09.319
Cupcake danced around.

9
00:01:09.320 --> 00:01:12.993
She tapped her feet.

10
00:01:12.994 --> 00:01:27.406
She waved her hands.

11
00:01:27.407 --> 00:01:32.832
Cupcake danced by a box.

12
00:01:32.833 --> 00:01:40.533
"Hello, box!" she sang. "Hello, plate!"

13
00:01:40.534 --> 00:01:45.672
She danced by the sink.

14
00:01:45.673 --> 00:02:00.642
"Hello, sponge! Hello, dish soap!"

15
00:02:00.643 --> 00:02:11.248
Cupcake danced by a cup.

16
00:02:11.249 --> 00:02:21.629
A blueberry sat on the rim.

17
00:02:21.630 --> 00:02:26.715
"Oh, hello!" Cupcake said.

18
00:02:26.716 --> 00:02:30.385
"I'm Cupcake!"

19
00:02:30.386 --> 00:02:33.665
The blueberry smiled.

20
00:02:33.666 --> 00:02:39.954
"Hello, Cupcake. I'm Berry."

21
00:02:39.955 --> 00:02:46.750
Cupcake danced past the cup.

22
00:02:46.751 --> 00:02:49.692
She did kicks.

23
00:02:49.693 --> 00:02:53.500
Her foot hit the cup.

24
00:02:53.501 --> 00:02:59.184
"Whoa!" Berry fell.

25
00:02:59.185 --> 00:03:03.130
He rolled toward the counter's edge.

26
00:03:03.131 --> 00:03:05.929
"Help!"

